  "description": "<div>\r\n<div data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-id=\"ecdf90ce-6c6c-4aa8-a9af-5a0c05eebdd3\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p data-is-only-node=\"\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-end=\"758\" data-start=\"0\">Arconya is a premium footwear brand specializing in handcrafted men&rsquo;s dress shoes. Founded in the 1950s in Amman, Jordan, the brand is known for its high-quality craftsmanship, using full-grain calf leather. Arconya&rsquo;s collection includes Oxfords, Derbies, Loafers, and Boots, combining timeless elegance with durability. Their shoes are designed for sophistication and comfort, catering to professionals and style-conscious individuals. The brand emphasizes traditional shoemaking techniques while incorporating modern aesthetics. Arconya also offers exotic leather designs like alligator print Chelsea boots, reflecting a balance of luxury and practicality. With a legacy of fine craftsmanship, Arconya continues to be a sought-after name in men&rsquo;s footwear.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div tabindex=\"0\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div><span data-state=\"closed\"><button data-testid=\"copy-turn-action-button\" aria-label=\"Copy\"></button></span>\r\n<div><span data-state=\"closed\"><button data-testid=\"good-response-turn-action-button\" aria-label=\"Good response\"></button></span><span data-state=\"closed\"><button data-testid=\"bad-response-turn-action-button\" aria-label=\"Bad response\"></button></span></div>\r\n<span data-state=\"closed\"><button data-testid=\"voice-play-turn-action-button\" aria-label=\"Read aloud\"></button></span><span data-state=\"closed\"><button aria-label=\"Edit in canvas\"></button></span>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<span data-state=\"closed\"><button data-state=\"closed\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" id=\"radix-:r34:\" type=\"button\"></button></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>",
